      "message": "Maybe unconditionally do stem \u003d m.(*libraryDecorator).GetStem() rather than reconstructing it?\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/rust/library.go;l\u003d607;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1",
